flowchart LR
  User[Designer / researcher] --> UI[Quantum Circuit Studio UI]
  UI <--> Model[Local circuit model\nJSON schema v0.1]
  Model --> Graph[Topology graph]
  Model --> Rules[Local checks\nIDs · links · readout · frequency]
  Model --> Optimizer[Transparent optimizer\nplacement + frequency targets]
  Graph --> Schematic[Schematic 2D]
  Graph --> Topology[Topology Lens 3D]
  Graph --> Layers[Material Layer Stack]
  Rules --> Heatmap[Frequency + crosstalk maps]
  Model --> JSON[Portable JSON]
  Graph --> QASM[OpenQASM 3 scaffold]
  Layers --> Mechanical[Conceptual STL / STEP]
  QASM -. optional handoff .-> QPU[Backend / QPU workflow]
  Mechanical -. optional handoff .-> EM[Layout / EM workflow]
